dw-dp: audio support, Collabora's "drm/bridge: synopsys: dw-dp: Add audio
support" (Sebastian Reichel) adapted to 7.3.5: no runtime PM yet, so the
startup/shutdown PM calls go, and the SDP lock, dw_dp_clear_sdp() and the
SDP slot return value it relies on are added here.

